  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The number of paramagnetic species among the following is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>He</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The species that contain unpaired electrons are paramagnetic.</p><p>Electronic configuration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> molecule is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>The electronic configuration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> molecule is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>&#8902;</mo></msup><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>&#8902;</mo></msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>The presence of unpaired electrons in the two <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi></math> bonding molecular orbitals explains its paramagnetic nature.</p><p>The electronic configuration of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KK</mi><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>KK</mi><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msub><mo>*</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msub><mo>*</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;molecule is paramagnetic.</p><p>The electronic configuration of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>&#8902;</mo></msup><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>&#8902;</mo></msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence, it is paramagnetic substance.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>KK</mi><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msub><mo>*</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msub><mo>*</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>KK</mi><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msub><mo>*</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msub><mo>*</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, the above species is paramagnetic.</p></blockquote>",
